refused: d101_plain_value_where_unit_is_asked.cy:9:44, line 9 column 44
 9 |     let $b: i32[unit: time.seconds] set_to $x;
   |                                            ^^
 what: this is `i32`, where `i32[unit: time.seconds]` is needed
 why:  the compiler checks units, and mixing them is refused (D100, D101)
